  "intended_use": "Exploratory measurement of how much extra predictors change discrimination; not a deployed model, a diagnosis or a clinical decision tool.",
  "limitations": [
    "Every feature set is scored on the ablation cohort (complete on all predictors), so its current_pre_lab row can differ slightly from the published model.",
    "Medical-history and education questions are asked only of adults 20 and older, so the ablation cohort excludes 18- and 19-year-olds.",
    "Low hemoglobin is partly a consequence of CKD, not only a risk factor.",
    "Medication classes come from drug names; prescription reason codes are excluded.",
    "The ablation design was written after exploratory runs on the same data.",
    "No scorer is exported; a richer set may select a tree family."
  ],
